.SS Invocation
.SS Test multiples hosts
.sp
By default Testinfra launch tests on local machine, but you can also
test remotes systems using paramiko \%<https://\:www\:.paramiko\:.org> (a
ssh implementation in python):
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
$ pip install paramiko
$ pytest \-v \-\-hosts=localhost,root@webserver:2222 test_myinfra.py

====================== test session starts ======================
platform linux \-\- Python 2.7.3 \-\- py\-1.4.26 \-\- pytest\-2.6.4
plugins: testinfra
