>>> host.file(\(dq/etc/passwd\(dq).exists
True
>>> host.file(\(dq/nonexistent\(dq).exists
False
.EE
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B property is_file
Test if the path is a regular file
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B property is_directory
Test if the path exists and a directory
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B property is_executable
